Compose O'Clock — Playful Watch Fork
=====================================

This repository combines:

1. Sample watch faces and apps from the Compose O'Clock project
   (Copyright Louis CAD / Splitties, Apache License 2.0).

2. Clean-room implementations of the missing Compose O'Clock library modules:
   - oclock-core
   - oclock-watchface-renderer

   These modules reimplement the public API used by the sample so the project
   builds without unavailable Splitties Maven artifacts. They are licensed
   under Apache License 2.0 by ahugenb333.

The original Splitties Compose O'Clock library remains commercially licensed
for Play Store distribution per the upstream README. This fork is intended for
open-source development, sideloading, and experimentation.

See LICENSE for the Apache License 2.0 text.
